<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#000000" />
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark" />
    <meta name="description" content="Secret Network mainnet (secret-4) chain snapshot." />
    <title>Secret³ — secret-4 snapshot</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg: #030303;
        --fg: #f4f4f4;
        --fg-muted: rgba(244, 244, 244, 0.72);
        --fg-faint: rgba(244, 244, 244, 0.45);
        --fg-ghost: rgba(244, 244, 244, 0.22);
        --line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
        --ease: cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
        --font: "IBM Plex Sans", "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;
        --font-mono: "IBM Plex Mono", ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Menlo, monospace;
      }
      *,
      *::before,
      *::after {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      html,
      body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100%;
        background: var(--bg);
        color: var(--fg);
      }
      body {
        min-height: 100dvh;
        font-family: var(--font);
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 1.5;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      }
      .stage {
        max-width: 42rem;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: max(2rem, env(safe-area-inset-top)) 1.25rem max(3rem, env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1.5rem;
      }
      .brand {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: var(--font);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        color: var(--fg-faint);
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .brand:hover {
        color: var(--fg);
      }
      .kicker {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: var(--font);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--fg-ghost);
      }
      h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.15rem);
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        line-height: 1.25;
      }
      .lede {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1.125rem;
        line-height: 1.55;
        color: var(--fg-muted);
      }
      code {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.92em;
      }
      .run {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 1rem 1.05rem 0.95rem;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        background: #0a0a0a;
      }
      .run header {
        display: flex;
        align-items: baseline;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
      }
      .run h2,
      .files h2 {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: var(--font);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--fg-faint);
      }
      .copy {
        font-family: var(--font);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        color: var(--fg-muted);
        background: none;
        border: 0;
        padding: 0;
        cursor: pointer;
      }
      .copy:hover,
      .copy:focus-visible {
        color: var(--fg);
        outline: none;
      }
      pre {
        margin: 0;
        overflow-x: auto;
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        line-height: 1.55;
        color: var(--fg);
      }
      .note {
        margin: 0.7rem 0 0;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        line-height: 1.5;
        color: var(--fg-muted);
      }
      .facts {
        margin: 0;
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.55rem 1.25rem;
        grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        letter-spacing: 0;
      }
      .facts dt {
        color: var(--fg-faint);
        font-family: var(--font);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      }
      .facts dd {
        margin: 0;
        overflow-wrap: anywhere;
        color: var(--fg);
      }
      .files ul {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        list-style: none;
      }
      .files li {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      }
      .files a {
        display: block;
        padding: 0.65rem 0;
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 1rem;
        color: var(--fg);
        text-decoration: none;
        letter-spacing: 0;
      }
      .files a:hover {
        color: #fff;
      }
      .warn {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        line-height: 1.5;
        color: var(--fg-muted);
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="stage">
      <a class="brand" href="https://secret3.dev">Secret³.dev</a>
      <p class="kicker">secret-4 · mainnet · snapshot</p>
      <h1>Pruned chain data for a new node.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Pruned secret-4 snapshot (app state + Comet, compacted — same job as cosmprund).
        Cosmprund cannot open Secret 1.26, so this file is from our prune tool.
        Replace <code>~/.secretd/data</code> (and <code>.compute</code> if present).
        Keep Cosmos keys and the enclave. First join or a node that was behind: extract
        and start. Not an archive.
      </p>

      <section class="run" aria-labelledby="run-h">
        <header>
          <h2 id="run-h">Paste this</h2>
          <button type="button" class="copy" id="copy">Copy</button>
        </header>
        <pre id="cmd">curl -fsSL -H 'Cache-Control: no-cache' -o restore.sh "https://mainnet-secret-snapshot.secret3.dev/restore.sh?t=$(date +%s)" &amp;&amp; bash restore.sh</pre>
        <p class="note">
          That one line replaces <code>./restore.sh</code> and runs it. It verifies the snapshot, then replaces <code>~/.secretd/data</code>. Your validator key and <code>config.toml</code> stay. It will not run on <code>archive-00</code> or <code>archive-01</code>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <dl class="facts" id="facts">
        <dt>chain</dt>
        <dd id="f-chain">secret-4</dd>
        <dt>height</dt>
        <dd id="f-height">…</dd>
        <dt>created</dt>
        <dd id="f-created">…</dd>
        <dt>size</dt>
        <dd id="f-size">…</dd>
        <dt>sha256</dt>
        <dd id="f-sha">…</dd>
      </dl>

      <section class="files" aria-labelledby="files-h">
        <h2 id="files-h">Files</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/latest.tar.zst">latest.tar.zst</a></li>
          <li><a href="/latest.sha256">latest.sha256</a></li>
          <li><a href="/latest.json">latest.json</a></li>
          <li><a href="/restore.sh">restore.sh</a></li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      <p class="warn">
        The tarball does not contain the network seed. If this node is already above
        the snapshot, the script stops and leaves your data in place. An enclave that
        has executed a higher block has to be reset and registered again
        (<code>secretd reset-enclave</code>, then <code>tx register auth</code>) before
        an older snapshot can start. Same Cosmos keys. Need history? Use archive
        RPC/LCD, not this tarball.
      </p>
    </main>
    <script>
      const cmd = document.getElementById("cmd").textContent.trim();
      document.getElementById("copy").addEventListener("click", async (ev) => {
        try {
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(cmd);
          ev.target.textContent = "Copied";
        } catch {
          ev.target.textContent = "Select the line";
        }
      });
      fetch("/latest.json", { cache: "no-store" })
        .then((r) => (r.ok ? r.json() : Promise.reject()))
        .then((j) => {
          const bytes = Number(j.size_bytes);
          const size =
            Number.isFinite(bytes) && bytes > 0
              ? (bytes / 1024 ** 3).toFixed(1) + " GiB"
              : "—";
          document.getElementById("f-chain").textContent = j.chain_id || "secret-4";
          document.getElementById("f-height").textContent = j.height || "—";
          document.getElementById("f-created").textContent = j.created_at || "—";
          document.getElementById("f-size").textContent = size;
          document.getElementById("f-sha").textContent = j.sha256 || "—";
          const file = j.file;
          if (file) {
            const a = document.querySelector('a[href="/latest.tar.zst"]');
            if (a) a.textContent = "latest.tar.zst → " + file;
          }
        })
        .catch(() => {
          document.getElementById("f-height").textContent = "not published yet";
        });
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
